{number: 5}
{title: Holy, Holy, Holy, Lord God Almighty!}
{key: Eb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] Lord [Eb] God Al-[Ab] migh-[Eb] ty!
[Bb] Early [Eb] in the [Bb] mor-[Cm] ning our [Bb] song shall [F7] rise to [Bb] Thee; [Bb7]
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] mer-[Eb] ciful and [Ab] migh-[Eb] ty!
[Cm] God in Three [Eb] Per-[Ab] sons, [Fm] blessed [Bb7] Trini-[Eb] ty!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] all the [Eb] saints a-[Ab] dore [Eb] Thee,
[Bb] Casting [Eb] down their [Bb] gol-[Cm] den crowns a-[Bb] round the [F7] glassy [Bb] sea; [Bb7]
[Eb] Cherubim and [Cm] seraphim [Bb] falling [Eb] down be-[Ab] fore [Eb] Thee,
[Cm] Who wert, and [Eb] art, [Ab] and [Fm] ever-[Bb7] more shalt [Eb] be.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] though the [Eb] darkness [Ab] hide [Eb] Thee,
[Bb] Though the [Eb] eye of [Bb] sin-[Cm] ful man Thy [Bb] glory [F7] may not [Bb] see; [Bb7]
[Eb] Only Thou art [Cm] holy; [Bb] there is [Eb] none be-[Ab] side [Eb] Thee,
[Cm] Perfect in [Eb] power, [Ab] in [Fm] love, and [Bb7] puri-[Eb] ty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] Lord [Eb] God Al-[Ab] migh-[Eb] ty!
[Bb] All Thy [Eb] works shall [Bb] praise [Cm] Thy Name, in [Bb] earth and [F7] sky and [Bb] sea; [Bb7]
[Eb] Holy, holy, [Cm] holy! [Bb] mer-[Eb] ciful and [Ab] migh-[Eb] ty!
[Cm] God in Three [Eb] Per-[Ab] sons, [Fm] blessed [Bb7] Trini-[Eb] ty.
{end_of_verse}
